### E-commerce API Examples
### Base URL
@base_url = http://localhost:3002

### Variables (replace after login)
@user_token = YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE
@admin_token = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### --------------------------------------------------
### Public Endpoints
### --------------------------------------------------

### Health Check
GET {{base_url}}/health

### List Products (Public)
GET {{base_url}}/products?page=1&size=12&sort=latest

### Get Product by ID
GET {{base_url}}/products/1

### Get Product by Slug
GET {{base_url}}/products/sample-product

### Search Products
GET {{base_url}}/products?q=laptop&category=1

### List Categories
GET {{base_url}}/products/categories

### --------------------------------------------------
### User Authentication
### --------------------------------------------------

### Register User
POST {{base_url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Smith",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login User
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get Current User Profile
GET {{base_url}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### User Profile Management
### --------------------------------------------------

### Get My Profile
GET {{base_url}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Update My Profile
PATCH {{base_url}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice M. Smith",
  "address": {
    "line1": "123 Main Street",
    "line2": "Apt 4B",
    "city": "San Francisco",
    "state": "CA",
    "postal_code": "94102",
    "country": "USA",
    "phone": "+1-555-0100"
  }
}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Cart Operations
### --------------------------------------------------

### Get My Cart
GET {{base_url}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Add Product to Cart
POST {{base_url}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Update Cart Item Quantity
PATCH {{base_url}}/cart/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### Remove Item from Cart
DELETE {{base_url}}/cart/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Clear Entire Cart
DELETE {{base_url}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Wishlist Operations
### --------------------------------------------------

### Get My Wishlist
GET {{base_url}}/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Add Product to Wishlist
POST {{base_url}}/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 3
}

### Remove Product from Wishlist
DELETE {{base_url}}/wishlist/3
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Clear Entire Wishlist
DELETE {{base_url}}/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Orders
### --------------------------------------------------

### Checkout and Create Order
POST {{base_url}}/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_method": "cod",
  "address": {
    "line1": "123 Main St",
    "city": "Metropolis",
    "state": "CA",
    "postal_code": "94000",
    "country": "USA",
    "phone": "+1-555-0199"
  }
}

### List My Orders
GET {{base_url}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Get My Order Details
GET {{base_url}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Contact Messages (Public)
### --------------------------------------------------

### Submit Contact Message
POST {{base_url}}/contact/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "subject": "Product Inquiry",
  "message": "I have a question about product availability and shipping options."
}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Admin Authentication & Self-Management
### --------------------------------------------------

### Admin Register (create new admin)
# Note: In production, this may require existing admin authentication
POST {{base_url}}/admin/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Admin Login
POST {{base_url}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Admin Login (with newly registered admin)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Get Current Admin Profile
# Requires: Admin Bearer token
GET {{base_url}}/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Update Current Admin Profile
# Allows updating username (must be unique)
PUT {{base_url}}/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_updated"
}

### List All Admin Users
# Returns all admin accounts in the system
GET {{base_url}}/admin/admins
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Admin Dashboard
### --------------------------------------------------

### Get Dashboard KPIs
GET {{base_url}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Admin Products Management
### --------------------------------------------------

### Admin List All Products
GET {{base_url}}/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin Create Product
POST {{base_url}}/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gaming Laptop Pro",
  "slug": "gaming-laptop-pro",
  "description": "High-performance gaming laptop with RTX graphics",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 25,
  "category_id": 1,
  "image_url": "/static/uploads/laptop.jpg",
  "is_active": true
}

### Admin Get Product
GET {{base_url}}/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin Update Product
PATCH {{base_url}}/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 30,
  "price": 1199.99
}

### Admin Delete Product
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Admin Users Management
### --------------------------------------------------

### Admin List All Users
GET {{base_url}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin Get User
GET {{base_url}}/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin Activate User
PATCH {{base_url}}/admin/users/1?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin Deactivate User
PATCH {{base_url}}/admin/users/1?active=false
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Admin Orders Management
### --------------------------------------------------

### Admin List All Orders
GET {{base_url}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin Get Order
GET {{base_url}}/admin/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin Update Order Status
PATCH {{base_url}}/admin/orders/1?status_value=shipped
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin Delete Order (only pending/cancelled)
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/orders/5
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Admin Contact Messages
### --------------------------------------------------

### List Contact Messages (Admin, Paginated)
GET {{base_url}}/contact/admin/messages?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Delete Contact Message (Admin)
DELETE {{base_url}}/contact/admin/messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### --------------------------------------------------
### Admin File Upload
### --------------------------------------------------

### Upload Image (Admin) - Valid JPEG
# Requirements:
# - MIME type must be image/jpeg, image/png, or image/webp
# - Maximum file size: 5MB
# - Returns 201 with URL on success
POST {{base_url}}/admin/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="product.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./product.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Upload Image (Admin) - Valid PNG
POST {{base_url}}/admin/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="banner.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./banner.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Upload Image (Admin) - Valid WebP
POST {{base_url}}/admin/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="thumbnail.webp"
Content-Type: image/webp

< ./thumbnail.webp
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Upload Image (Admin) - Invalid MIME Type (415 Error)
# Expected response: 415 Unsupported Media Type
# Error: "Unsupported file type. Allowed: image/jpeg, image/png, image/webp"
POST {{base_url}}/admin/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./document.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Upload Image (Admin) - Invalid MIME Type GIF (415 Error)
# Expected response: 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{base_url}}/admin/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="animation.gif"
Content-Type: image/gif

< ./animation.gif
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Upload Image (Admin) - File Too Large (413 Error)
# Expected response: 413 Request Entity Too Large
# Error: "File too large. Maximum size: 5.0MB"
# Note: Replace with an actual file larger than 5MB for testing
POST {{base_url}}/admin/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="large-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./large-image-over-5mb.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
